# Package Manager: pnpm

Always use **pnpm** for all Node.js package management tasks in this project.

## Rules

- **Always use pnpm** instead of npm or yarn
- Use `pnpm install` instead of `npm install`
- Use `pnpm add <package>` instead of `npm install <package>`
- Use `pnpm run <script>` instead of `npm run <script>`
- Use `pnpm exec <command>` instead of `npx <command>`
- Never use npm or yarn commands

## Frontend

The frontend project uses pnpm as the package manager. All package management commands should use pnpm.
